Well, the thing is, we're trying to steer away from ethnocentrism. So,
although we can't incorporate any *specific* harvest festival, we do have to
choose which harvest time we want to celebrate. For instance, the Incans had
a harvest celebration that co-incided with the summer solstice, because
that's when the growing season ended. Obviously different climates of the
world will have different harvest celebration times. So, maybe the player
can pick which calendar they want to observe at the beginning or something.
Or, maybe is OSes start coming with GIS data, we can deduce which calendar
to use.

